elastalert-rs is an independent Rust reimplementation of the behaviour of
ElastAlert 2 (https://github.com/jertel/elastalert2), Copyright Yelp and the
ElastAlert 2 contributors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
Rule files, configuration keys, log lines and writeback document formats are
kept compatible with ElastAlert 2 on purpose.

